  "bodyHash": "m2yCIA8LWPg=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Homestead/BH_Homestead_header.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">官方 Homestead 模組包</h1><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b22205d972d2006c6bd3ff913524a33f8a5761e.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252ftokimi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Homestead/BH_Homestead_promo2.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Homestead/BH_Homestead_videos.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/edm0HUj9sTg\" width=\"775\" height=\"437\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4F1_rLGVyLM\" width=\"775\" height=\"437\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Lq32O22MDhw\" width=\"775\" height=\"435\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LbWjmckHuNw\" width=\"775\" height=\"437\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252f5b22205d972d2006c6bd3ff913524a33f8a5761e.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b22205d972d2006c6bd3ff913524a33f8a5761e.png</a>)</p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\">![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fimages%252fCF%252fHomestead%252fBH_Homestead_features.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Homestead/BH_Homestead_features.webp</a>)</h2><h3>🌎 豐富且手工打造的世界：</h3><ul>\n<li>透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ftectonic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tectonic</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fgeophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic</a> 等模組，擁有鬱鬱蔥蔥的森林、遼闊的田野、崎嶇的山脈和寧靜的河流的自訂世界生成</li>\n<li>藉由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frepurposed-structures-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fYUNGNICKYOUNG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG</a> 的所有模組，手工放置的建築物和程序生成的廢墟自然地融入景觀中</li>\n<li>使用增強的地形模組，在保有舒適的原版+風格的同時，實現生態系多樣性，例如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnatures-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Spirit</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a></li>\n</ul><h3>📖 引導式但自由的遊戲玩法：</h3><ul>\n<li>廣泛的任務書，獎勵探索、創造力和生存技巧</li>\n<li>章節圍繞主題組織（家園建設、野外探索、深度採礦、魔法秘密）</li>\n<li>無強制路徑 — 以你自己的步調和方式探索</li>\n</ul><h3>🎨 內建光影，帶來終極電影體驗：</h3><p>Homestead 已預先安裝了精美的光影，無需額外下載！</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Reimagined</a> - 包含三種預設：低、中、極高</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fnostalgia-shader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nostalgia Shader</a> - 營造柔和、夢幻的氛圍</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fmakeup-ultra-fast-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MakeUp - UltraFast</a> - 輕量且高度可自訂</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fpotato-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Potato Shaders</a> - 非常適合低階電腦</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fsuper-duper-vanilla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Super Duper Vanilla</a> - 經典 Minecraft 外觀下的美麗光影</li>\n</ul><h3>🛠️ 擴展的生存體驗：</h3><ul>\n<li>透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmythic-upgrades\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Upgrades</a> 模組，使用紅寶石、黃玉、橄欖石、藍寶石、翡翠、海藍寶石和紫黃晶等自訂寶石製作的新工具和盔甲</li>\n<li>自訂合成配方和重新平衡的原版進程，帶來更慢、更有成就感的生存體驗</li>\n<li>藉由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffarmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fcollection%252fqKHEyt1l%252fmods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's Do Mods</a> 等模組，實現包含農作物、樹木和牲畜增強的更真實農耕</li>\n</ul><h3>🐾 新的野生動物與生物：</h3><ul>\n<li>自訂生物，例如<strong>蘑菇仔</strong>和<strong>蕨類精靈</strong> — 來自我們的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cozystudios-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>自訂 CozyStudios Core 模組！</strong></a>的可馴服並一起冒險的友善夥伴</li>\n<li>獨特的坐騎和可騎乘生物，自然融入世界中</li>\n<li>潛伏在洞穴、森林和隱蔽林地中的生物變種和小 Boss</li>\n</ul><h3>🧭 探索與冒險：</h3><ul>\n<li>散落在陸地上的古老建築、廢墟、神社和秘密</li>\n<li>寶藏狩獵和稀有神器，例如賦予特殊力量的<strong>金葉</strong></li>\n<li>神秘生態系，孕育著稀有生物、魔法植物和強大的遺物</li>\n</ul><h3>🏡 舒適的建築與家園建設：</h3><ul>\n<li>數百種建築方塊，包含木材種類、石頭、屋瓦、橫樑和舒適的裝飾，感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fchipped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chipped</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftwigs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twigs</a> 等模組</li>\n<li>家具、照明和裝飾模組，幫助你建造完美的村舍、城堡或小屋，感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcluttered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cluttered</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beautify: Refabricated</a> 等模組</li>\n<li>進階儲存解決方案（箱子、板條箱、背包等等！），感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fironchests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Chests: Restocked</a> 等模組</li>\n</ul><h3>⚙️ 機械與魔法強化：</h3><ul>\n<li>使用專為 Homestead 調整的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 模組強化，實現原版風格自動化</li>\n<li>可選的科技，平衡以符合鄉村氛圍（無高科技雜亂），例如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftoms-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tom's Simple Storage</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwirelessredstone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wireless Redstone</a></li>\n</ul><h3>🧡 滿腔熱愛的作品：</h3><ul>\n<li>超過 4 個月的開發時間，精心調整每個系統，以創造溫馨、誘人的生存體驗</li>\n<li>非常適合單人冒險者、小型朋友群組或社群伺服器</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b22205d972d2006c6bd3ff913524a33f8a5761e.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>請查閱 Wiki 以獲取更多資訊，並追蹤你可能會發現的問題或錯誤！</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/iamtokimi/homestead/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-Wiki-181717?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Github\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qHB5D9uzHe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1314787848779726920?color=blue&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@iamtokimii\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCAdrG5UY_FB68fDC2G8PTpA?style=for-the-badge&amp;label=Youtube&amp;labelColor=CD201F\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b22205d972d2006c6bd3ff913524a33f8a5761e.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>💞 特別感謝</h2><h3>感謝所有參與 Beta 測試的人，幫助我們找出所有錯誤和問題。</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIaVT7Cm0ilw9Rjd8i0J-7g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Meleon（副開發者）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH4IkMCZ92_OHgeNM9imstA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xodk</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/valusdagon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Army</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsteamcommunity.com%252fprofiles%252f76561199141628758\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lyn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYHsM506gBSsBxejoOTJTrA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alexelle</a></li>\n<li>Nylon</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/gonzozeroone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gonzo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaTjVD_qZHOVspTK_cVsX8g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mama_native\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mama Native</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/snowylasvegasttv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Snowylasvegas</a></li>\n<li>Wistericle</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/kawatsuki15\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yuki</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnavinor.carrd.co%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Navinor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSodaSyrup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Salad（後端開發者）</a></li>\n</ul><h3>感謝協助我們編寫專屬模組並將我們的天馬行空想法化為現實的模組開發者們。</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjavivi.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Javivi（開發者）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252fraboy13\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raboy（動畫師）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252ffflash_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flash（模型/材質）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fLunarEclipseStudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bret06（開發者）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvgen.co%252fartmanoil\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artmanoil（自訂 GUI/材質包人員）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgigoe.shop%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gigoe（主選單/載入畫面美術師）</a></li>\n</ul><h3>也非常感謝 Slugv 為這個美麗的模組包製作了最棒的標誌和圖示。沒有你，這一切不可能如此精彩地實現。</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b22205d972d2006c6bd3ff913524a33f8a5761e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
